{"subjectId":"ml-ai","id":"ml_pipeline","title":"End-to-End ML Pipeline","group":"Implementation","order":11,"html":"<p class=\"lead\">The continuous lifecycle of an engineering-grade Machine Learning system.</p>\n<section class=\"block\">\n<h3><i class=\"ti ti-route\"></i>Pipeline Overview</h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 700 240\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n<path d=\"M 0 2 L 10 5 L 0 8 z\" fill=\"var(--accent)\" />\n</marker>\n</defs>\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"30\" width=\"130\" height=\"45\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"var(--bg3)\" stroke=\"var(--border)\" />\n<text x=\"85\" y=\"58\" fill=\"var(--text)\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">1. Formulate Goal</text>\n<line x1=\"150\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" />\n<rect x=\"190\" y=\"30\" width=\"130\" height=\"45\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"var(--bg3)\" stroke=\"var(--border)\" />\n<text x=\"255\" y=\"58\" fill=\"var(--text)\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">2. Ingest &amp; Label</text>\n<line x1=\"320\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" />\n<rect x=\"360\" y=\"30\" width=\"130\" height=\"45\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"var(--bg3)\" stroke=\"var(--border)\" />\n<text x=\"425\" y=\"58\" fill=\"var(--text)\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">3. Feature Eng</text>\n<line x1=\"490\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"530\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" />\n<rect x=\"530\" y=\"30\" width=\"130\" height=\"45\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"var(--bg3)\" stroke=\"var(--border)\" />\n<text x=\"595\" y=\"58\" fill=\"var(--text)\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">4. Model &amp; Train</text>\n<path d=\"M 595 75 L 595 120 L 85 120 L 85 150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent2)\" stroke-dasharray=\"3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" />\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"150\" width=\"130\" height=\"45\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"var(--bg3)\" stroke=\"var(--border)\" />\n<text x=\"85\" y=\"178\" fill=\"var(--text)\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">5. Error Analysis</text>\n<line x1=\"150\" y1=\"172\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"172\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" />\n<rect x=\"190\" y=\"150\" width=\"130\" height=\"45\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"var(--bg3)\" stroke=\"var(--border)\" />\n<text x=\"255\" y=\"178\" fill=\"var(--text)\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">6. Evaluate &amp; Validate</text>\n<line x1=\"320\" y1=\"172\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"172\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" />\n<rect x=\"360\" y=\"150\" width=\"130\" height=\"45\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"var(--bg3)\" stroke=\"var(--border)\" />\n<text x=\"425\" y=\"178\" fill=\"var(--text)\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">7. Deploy (Canary/Shadow)</text>\n<line x1=\"490\" y1=\"172\" x2=\"530\" y2=\"172\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" />\n<rect x=\"530\" y=\"150\" width=\"130\" height=\"45\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"var(--bg3)\" stroke=\"var(--border)\" />\n<text x=\"595\" y=\"178\" fill=\"var(--text)\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">8. Monitor &amp; Retrain</text>\n<path d=\"M 595 195 L 595 220 L 255 220 L 255 75\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--green)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\" />\n<text x=\"425\" y=\"215\" fill=\"var(--green)\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Data/Concept Drift Retraining Loop</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"block\">\n<h3><i class=\"ti ti-list-numbers\"></i>Stage Descriptions</h3>\n<div class=\"card\">\n<p>1. <strong>Define Problem:</strong> Establish inputs, targets, and metrics.<br>\n2. <strong>Collect Data:</strong> Ingest logs, scrapings, or sensor data.<br>\n3. <strong>Clean Data:</strong> Deduplicate rows, drop invalid logs.<br>\n4. <strong>Annotate Data:</strong> Label datasets via active learning or weak supervision.<br>\n5. <strong>Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA):</strong> Identify feature statistics, distributions, and outliers.<br>\n6. <strong>Feature Engineering:</strong> Apply standardization, normalization, and scaling.<br>\n7. <strong>Train Model:</strong> Train candidate models (XGBoost, DNNs).<br>\n8. <strong>Validate Model:</strong> Compare candidate models on the validation set or via cross-validation.<br>\n9. <strong>Error Analysis:</strong> Categorize wrong predictions and evaluate performance slices.<br>\n10. <strong>Hyperparameter Tuning:</strong> Run Grid Search or Random Search on best candidates.<br>\n11. <strong>Final Evaluation:</strong> Verify performance on held-out test datasets; calculate statistical significance.<br>\n12. <strong>Deploy, Monitor &amp; Retrain:</strong> Route traffic using canary deploys, monitor for drift, and trigger scheduled retraining loops.</p>\n</div>\n</section>"}